This is a community-maintained Caddy module and is not an official CrowdSec
or Caddy component. RentnerProxy compiles its unchanged upstream HTTP package.
The upstream AppSec and Layer 4 modules are linked but remain unconfigured.
The build selects the upstream CrowdSec SDK v1.8.1 and Layer 4 module v0.1.3-0.20261023161224-4ad6aec1ccc6.
Dependency versions are resolved through the official Go proxy and checksum database.
No third-party source transforms or local forks are applied.
